config VP_FAULT_REPORT
	bool "Classify and report faults on the vcml-pydrofoil VP"
	default y
	help
	  Installs a k_sys_fatal_error_handler that tells a poison hit from an
	  ordinary fault and ends the run through the VP's simdev with a
	  distinguishing exit code.

	  Turn this off to supply your own handler; the two cannot coexist.
